      map                                         WCL_bc   vs true   ABS+mean
      RSSFIT (actual, systematic)                  3128m     5.39x      1254m
      same magnitudes, RANDOM directions           2001m     3.45x      1129m
      isotropic random at 5174 m                   2616m     4.51x      1471m
      CONTROL: magnitudes AND true directions      3128m     5.39x      1254m
      META-CHECK: the control must REPRODUCE RSSFIT (it is RSSFIT, rebuilt
      from magnitude+direction). 0.0 m apart -> PASS — the reconstruction is sound
      META-CHECK: do the three arms SEPARATE? spread 1127 m -> YES — error STRUCTURE matters, not only size
